## Data Model Requirements

This feature adds **no tables or columns**. PDFs are not stored. Generation reads existing Feature 3–4 rows.

Point at [Feature 3](./feature-3-recipe-management.md) for `recipes` (`name`, and the rest of the recipe row) and [Feature 4](./feature-4-recipe-ingredients-management.md) for `recipeIngredients` and `recipeSteps`. Catalog `ingredients` (`name`, `unit`) stay Feature 2.

### Associations (unchanged; used as PDF input)

- `Recipe` hasMany `RecipeIngredient` / `RecipeStep`
- `RecipeIngredient` belongsTo `Ingredient` (name, unit on the Ingredients list)
- `RecipeStep` has linked recipe ingredients (names on the Steps table)

No `pdfs` table, no PDF blob column, no filename column on `recipes`.

